Day 17/120 – Brand & Regional Analysis + Wireframing 📊

Today was one of those days where things started to connect.

I focused on brand analysis and regional performance for the mobile phone sales dashboard,  breaking down which brands are leading, which regions are underperforming, and where the real opportunities might be hiding.

It’s interesting how numbers tell different stories depending on how you look at them.

One region might have high revenue but low quantity sold.
Another might have high volume but lower revenue.
And certain brands clearly perform better in specific regions.

That’s why segmentation matters.

